    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09406_Index_04=Initial pH value every cycle varies from §c4.5§7 - §c9.5 pH
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09406_Index_05=If the pH value is within §c0.05 pH §7of 7.0 pH at the end of the cycle, the recipe always succeeds
