    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09406_Index_07=Use a pH Sensor Hatch to read the current pH value
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_09406_Index_08=For safety, the machine will shut down if the pH goes below 0 or exceeds 14
