    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10507_Index_00=機械の種類:§8《§e粒子加速器§8／Particle Accelerator》§r
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10507_Index_01=Torus-shaped, uses an electromagnetic field to make beams of charged particles travel in a circle
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10507_Index_02=Electrically neutral particles are therefore unaffected
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10507_Index_03=Due to the relativistic Larmor effect, it produces then outputs a photon beam
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10507_Index_04=The §9Beam Energy§7, §cBeam Focus§7, and §6Beam Rate§7 are all determined by the formulae in this tooltip
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10507_Index_05=Use a §bportable scanner §7for info about the input/output of this multiblock
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10507_Index_06=§7§m-----------------------------------------
