    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10507_Index_08=The input beam must have a §cFocus§7 of at least 25
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10507_Index_09=The §cOutput Beam Focus§7 can be improved by using lower temperature coolant
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_10507_Index_10=Valid coolants:
