    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_00=機械の種類: §eSpacetime Manipulator, EOH§r
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_01=Creates a pocket of spacetime that is bigger on the inside using transdimensional
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_02=engineering. Certified Time Lord regulation compliant. This multi uses too much EU
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_03=to be handled with conventional means. All EU requirements are handled directly by
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_04=your wireless EU network
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_05=§6§m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_06=This multiblock will constantly consume hydrogen and helium when it is not running a
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_07=recipe once per second. It will store this internally, you can see the totals by
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_08=using a scanner. This multi also has three tiered blocks with §c9§7 tiers
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_09=each. They are as follows and have the associated effects on the multi:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_10=§9Spacetime Compression Field Generator:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_11=- The tier of this block determines what recipes can be run. If the multiblocks
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_12=  spacetime compression field block exceeds the requirements of the recipe it
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_13=  will decrease the processing time by §c3%§7 per tier over the requirement (multiplicative)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_14=§9Time Dilation Field Generator:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_15=- Decreases the time required for a recipe by §c50%§7 per tier of block (multiplicative)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_16=  Decreases the probability of a recipe succeeding by §c9.25%§7 per tier (additive)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_17=§9Stabilisation Field Generator:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_18=- Increases the probability of a recipe succeeding by §c5%§7 per tier (additive)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_19=  Decreases the yield of a recipe by §c5%§7 per tier (additive). 
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_20=  > Low tier stabilisation field generators have a power output penalty
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_21=     The power output penalty for using Crude Stabilisation Field Generators is §c40%
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_22=     This penalty decreases by §c5%§7 per tier (additive)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_23=§6§m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_24=Going over a recipe requirement on hydrogen or helium has a penalty on yield and recipe chance
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_25=All stored hydrogen and helium is consumed during a craft. The associated formulas are:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_26=§aOverflow ratio = (Stored fluid / Recipe requirement) - 1
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_27=§aAdjustment value = 1 - exp(-(30 * Overflow ratio)^2)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_28=The Adjustment value is then subtracted from the total yield and recipe chance
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_29=§6§m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_30=It should be noted that base recipe chance is determined per recipe and yield always starts
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_31=at 1 and subtracts depending on penalties. All fluid/item outputs are multiplied by the
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_32=yield. Failure fluid is exempt
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_33=§6§m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_34=This multiblock can only output to ME output buses/hatches
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_35=§6§m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_36=This multiblock can be overclocked by placing a programmed circuit into the input bus
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_37=E.g. A circuit of 2 will provide 2 OCs, 16x EU input and 0.25x the time. EU output is unaffected
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_38=All outputs are equal. All item and fluid output chances & amounts per recipe are unaffected
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_39=§6§m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_40=If a recipe fails the EOH will output §aSuccess chance * 14,400 * (2.0)^(Recipe tier)§7L of molten
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_41=SpaceTime instead of fluid/item outputs and output as much EU as a successful recipe
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_42=§6§m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_43=This multiblock can perform parallel processing by placing Astral Array Fabricators into the input bus
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_44=They are stored internally and can be retrieved via right-clicking the controller with a wire cutter
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_45=The maximum amount of stored Astral Arrays is 8,637. Parallel amount is calculated via these formulas:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_46=§aParallel exponent = floor(log(8 * Astral Array amount) / log(1.7))
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_47=§aParallel = 2^(Parallel exponent)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_48=If the EOH is running parallel recipes, the power calculation changes
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_49=The power needed for parallel processing is calculated as follows:
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_50=§atotal EU = ((EU output - EU input * 1.63) / 20.7) * 2.3^(Parallel exponent)
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_51=Furthermore, if parallel recipes are run, the recipes consume Condensed Raw Stellar Plasma Mixture
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_52=instead of helium and hydrogen. Overflow penalties still apply
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_53=The required amount of fluid to start a recipe is §a12.4 / 10^6 * Helium amount * Parallel
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_54=The success or failure of each parallel is determined independently
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_55=§6§m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_56=§8《§7ドライバー§8／Screwdriver》§7で右クリックするとアニメーションを無効化できます
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_57=Planet block can be inserted directly by right-clicking the controller with planet block
    S:TileEntity_DESCRIPTION_15410_Index_58=§6§m---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
